Wait a minute! I just noticed a critical detail - in the market_scrape function, when you trade a higher-priced stock for a lower-priced stock, you get the lower-priced stock AND keep your original stock! There's no deduction of the original stock in this case.

Let's modify our exploit to take advantage of this:

